            "title": "Returning values",
            "id": 80382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon, kendisini çağıran koda bir değer döndürebilir. Bu program, görevini gerçekleştirmeye yardımcı olmak için kendisini çağıran koda bir değer döndürür.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #D5F5E3&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #85C1E9;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    color: #7c795d;&#xA;    font-family: 'Trocchi', serif;&#xA;    font-size: 45px;&#xA;    font-weight: normal;&#xA;    line-height: 48px;&#xA;    margin: 0;&#xA;    text-align: centre&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Pound Converter&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Add value in pounds.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;label&gt;Pounds&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;   &lt;input id=&quot;inputPounds&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; placeholder=&quot;Pounds&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onClick=&quot;convert()&quot;&gt;convert&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Kilograms: &lt;span id=&quot;outputKilograms&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function convert() {&#xA;    const pounds = document.getElementById(&quot;inputPounds&quot;).value;&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;outputKilograms&quot;).innerHTML = pounds /&#xA;     2.2046;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
